{"c":[{"name":"20261023T210428Z-bfb74039999452c2","text":"2026-10-23: M1-M3 are on main as squash 0e1e62e. Ship them as v3.0.0 by merging release-please PR 151 before milestone 4. Then restore memory-bank/active onto a new branch from that main. Do not rebase constrain-size-as-best-we-can.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261023T211708Z-b30e35daac19f4be","text":"2026-10-23: v3.0.0 is c9fbcc4. warehouse-file-growth restores memory-bank/active from constrain-size-as-best-we-can. Milestone 3 is checked. Milestone 4 is Level 2, the read-only doctor storage report. Do not rebase the old branch.","type":"note"}]}
